#8000
A huge cave~
   You are in a huge cave open to the sky, undoubtedly the lair and
doorway of the dragon that dwells within these caves.  The walls are
scorched and caked with thick soot from the fires spewed from its belly.
There is no gold here, whatever the fairy tales say; only bones, heaped
in drifts against the walls.  The heat is unbearable and the air hard to
breathe.  A passage leads south.
~
