#8001
Northwest Tower of Bryn Mawr~
   You step out of the stairway onto the deck of the northwest tower of
Bryn Mawr Castle.  Ramparts of krisahla stone encircle the edge of the
tower, a standard defense against arrows and other missiles.  From up
here you have an excellent view of the great cavern: its walls dance
with light reflected from the countless jewels set within them, and the
ceiling is still very far above you, lost in shadow.  The stairway leads
down.
~
