Throne of the King~
   The throne room is built entirely of the krisahla stone mined beneath
Bryn Mawr, its walls gleaming with a soft, pearly sheen.  A large red
tapestry hangs above the throne bearing the seal of Bryn Mawr, a golden
shield and a hammer of fire, and a carpet with the same symbol runs
before it.  Braziers burn on either side.  To the south a large archway
leads out of the throne room.
