#8042
Before the Castle~
   The walls of the castle rise before you into the mighty heights of
the cavern that holds both castle and town.  Unlike most castles in the
realm, its exterior is plain and almost unadorned, built for strength
rather than beauty, though the krisahla stone gleams softly of its own
accord.  A great gate leads north into the castle, and to the south a
road winds between large, jeweled stalagmites toward the Township of
Bryn Mawr.
~
